From 97c30a9543eb10e9b003b51fb425d84ca762570a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 09:43:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Harden the issuer: ticketed registration, quieter admin,
 login rate limits.

Public self-registration now requires a one-time ticket minted by a
confidential OAuth client with client_secret. Invite-only apps are
unchanged. GET / is 404, /admin is 404 unless the session is admin,
and leftover accounts can be deleted from the admin user list.
